{"id":"wb-7-152","name":"固城遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"固城遗址","text":"固城遗址位于江苏省南京市高淳区城东10公里固城镇。固城遗址呈长方形，南北约800米，东西约1000米，外城周长3915米，遗址内发现了大量西周、秦、汉、唐等朝代的文物。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9B%BA%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":86555094,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86555094","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":null}